<h1>Sing with Ensemble Continuo</h1>
<hr>
<p>
    Ensemble Continuo is a chamber choir comprised primarily of adults based in Palo Alto, California. We welcome experienced youth and adult singers of all voice parts (Soprano, Alto, Tenor, Bass) who share a passion for singing challenging classical repertoire in a supportive setting. Rehearsals take place Thursday evenings in Palo Alto.
</p>
<p>
    For full details on our rehearsal schedule, dues, and membership expectations, please visit our <a href="/pages/faqs.html">FAQs</a>.
</p>

<h3>Request an Audition</h3>
<p>
    Please fill out the inquiry form below, and our director will contact you with audition details.
</p>

